out.push("\n\n不推荐将所有内容塞到 alt 中：\n\n```html\n<img\n  src=\"size-guide.jpg\"\n  alt=\"A is shoulder... B is chest... C is length...\"\n>\n```\n\n更好的方式是使用简短 alt，并提供完整的 HTML 说明。\n\n```html\n<figure>\n  <img\n    src=\"size-guide.jpg\"\n    alt=\"T-shirt measurement diagram showing A, B and C\"\n  >\n\n  <figcaption>\n    How to measure your T-shirt\n  </figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<dl>\n  <dt>A — Shoulder</dt>\n  <dd>\n    Measure across the back from one shoulder seam\n    to the other.\n  </dd>\n\n  <dt>B — Chest</dt>\n  <dd>\n    Measure horizontally across the chest.\n  </dd>\n\n  <dt>C — Length</dt>\n  <dd>\n    Measure from the highest shoulder point\n    to the bottom hem.\n  </dd>\n</dl>\n```\n\n如果图片中包含具体的尺寸数据，还应该将数据提供为语义化表格。\n\n这样所有用户都能够获得完整的信息，而不是只让屏幕阅读器用户听一段非常长的替代文本。");
